// Armour and shield sprites (content: base/blocks_armour.ron, combat.ron). One drawing per
// slot, recoloured per material: `a`-`c` the metal or hide (dark to light), `g` and `h` the
// trim, `k` and `l` straps; outlined in `D`. Hide sets are drawn in hide palettes,
// chainmail in a duller iron.
